          "pos": 4866
        }
      ],
      "words": 49
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "As if the universe sensed I was about to bail on this whole insane plan, my phone lights up with an incoming FaceTime ca",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5632
        }
      ],
      "words": 58
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "And as a last-ditch effort, Erin sent me a stash of her edibles to see if they'd relax me enough to get some words down.",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7992
        }
      ],
      "words": 35
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "What I don't say is that most of the people attending still live in Fairhope. This reunion isn't just for my graduating ",
